==Description==
'''Epic Backflips''' is an [[Emotes|emote]] that can be bought from the store for {{Coins|500}}. It was made by [https://www.roblox.com/users/109517370/profile painteduser]. The emote is looped and no music can be heard while performing the emote. You cannot move while performing this emote.

==Gallery==
{{Gallery|
{{GalleryHeader|Previous Animations}}
<gallery>
Epic_Backflips.gif|First version (9 November 2019 – 29 October 2020)
</gallery>
}}

==Trivia==
*Using this emote while ragdolled may cause a lot of player movement.
*This emote can be used to clip through walls and tight spaces.
**You can take advantage of this, as it can let you go to places that you are not allowed to go.

